    "created_at": "2019-06-05T09:12:47Z",
    "updated_at": "2019-06-05T09:12:47Z",
    "body": "The [Dolphin] reference there is to [DolphinAttack: Inaudible Voice Commands](https://arxiv.org/pdf/1708.09537.pdf).\r\n\r\n@padenot @hoch do you know if there's some mitigation for this in Web Audio or audio playback generally?",
